Changes in this TypeScript port:
- Replaced PyUSB with browser WebUSB and optional Node.js usb backends.
- Added strict validation, asynchronous lifecycle/serialization and fault isolation.
- Corrected start:false initialization and preserved RTR DLC independently of data.
- Added mock-only tests, Chinese documentation and examples; no hardware verification.

Source mapping:
- canalystii/protocol.py -> src/protocol.ts: constants and binary layouts.
- canalystii/device.py -> src/device.ts: device command/receive/send flow;
  endpoint assignments and the 18-entry timing table also moved to src/protocol.ts.
- The TypeScript package entry point is reorganized; it does not port a
  substantive implementation from the upstream __init__.py export-only API.

